| fetchRevenueDashboard | Loads revenue totals, trends, and payment information. |
| renderRevenueCharts | Draws revenue trends and payment breakdown charts. |
| fetchGcashIssues | Loads unresolved GCash reconciliation issues. |
| toggleGcashAlertDetails | Expands or collapses GCash issue details. |
| fetchTransactionLogs | Loads paginated recent payment transactions. |
| txLogsPrevPage | Moves to the previous payment-log page. |
| txLogsNextPage | Moves to the next payment-log page. |
| suggestedPaymentAmount | Calculates the selected vehicle payment suggestion. |
| onPaymentVehicleTypeChange | Recalculates payment fields after vehicle changes. |
| onPaymentDiscountChange | Updates discount requirements and payment amount. |
| recordPayment | Saves an administrator-verified parking payment. |
| formatPhp | Formats amounts using Philippine peso notation. |
| formatCompactPhp | Formats large peso values compactly. |

The payment form supports vehicle type, duration, discount, method, amount,
discount identification, notes, and backend payment recording.

