[ ] Filter, refresh, and review parking history.
[ ] Open Profile and sign out.
[ ] Test forgot-password email request.
[ ] Test small-screen and large-text layouts.


9. SOURCE AND RELEASE NOTES
===========================

The web templates share authentication but separate administrator and driver
workflows. The Flutter application shares one dashboard shell but selects the
administrator or driver workflow from the authenticated role.

Web reports support CSV and PDF downloads. Mobile reports preserve the same
report data and provide Copy CSV for mobile-safe export.

The deployed backend must configure password-reset SMTP variables before the
forgot-password feature can deliver real email messages:
PASSWORD_RESET_URL_BASE, SMTP_HOST, SMTP_PORT, SMTP_USER, SMTP_PASSWORD,
SMTP_FROM, and SMTP_USE_TLS.

