APPENDIX A — BEGINNER-FRIENDLY FUNCTION LIST
=============================================

Every explanation below contains exactly ten words and uses beginner-friendly wording.
The layout follows the sample: role, feature group, function, and explanation.


SHARED FUNCTIONS
================

- Onboarding walkthrough - Guides new drivers through parking features before they create accounts.
- User registration - Creates a driver account using the information they provide successfully.
- Login and password visibility toggle - Lets users sign in and show or hide their password.
- Password validation - Checks password length, letters, and numbers before accepting it securely.
- Role-based routing - Sends each user to the correct screen after signing in.
- Session restoration - Keeps users signed in when they reopen the application again.
- Logout - Ends the current session and returns users to the login.
- Session expiration handling - Sends users back to login when their session has ended.
- API connection/error handling - Shows a message when the app cannot reach the server.
- Render backend integration - Connects the website and app to the online parking system.
- Secure mobile token storage - Keeps mobile login details safely stored on the device securely.
- Web authenticated session cookies - Keeps users signed in safely while using the website system.


ADMIN WEB
=========

Navigation
----------

- Admin navigation - Opens seven administrator modules through responsive dashboard navigation controls easily.
- Sign out - Ends administrator session and returns safely to login page immediately.
- Theme toggle - Switches between dark and gray dashboard presentation preferences for administrators.
- Authenticated requests - Adds authenticated authorization headers before protected administrator requests are sent.
- Loading states - Shows skeleton placeholders while dashboard data requests are still pending.

Overview
--------

- Camera connection status - Reports whether configured cameras are currently reachable and streaming live.
- Lot pressure/status - Summarizes current parking demand and overall lot operating condition clearly.
- Last detector update - Displays the latest timestamp received from parking detection workers accurately.
- Free parking slots - Shows currently available parking spaces using live occupancy data only.
- Occupied slots - Shows currently occupied parking spaces using live occupancy data only.
- Total capacity - Displays total configured parking capacity for current parking operations clearly.
- Maximum vehicle count - Shows highest observed or predicted vehicle count for administrators today.
- Occupancy percentage - Displays current lot occupancy percentage derived from live counts accurately.
- Peak vehicles today - Shows today's highest vehicle count from current parking observations clearly.
- Today's revenue - Displays estimated or recorded revenue for the current day clearly.
- Dynamic pricing status - Shows whether occupancy-based pricing is currently active for parking users.
- Parking occupancy trend chart - Visualizes recent occupancy movement across recorded parking history periods clearly.
- AI next-hour forecast - Displays predicted occupancy for the next operating hour automatically onscreen.
- Predicted peak time - Identifies the forecast period with highest expected parking demand today.
- Occupancy trend description - Explains recent parking demand changes using readable generated status text.
- AI recommendation - Presents an operational action recommendation based on current parking intelligence.
- Refresh AI forecast - Requests the newest forecast and updates administrator prediction displays immediately.
