- Today's revenue - Shows total revenue recorded or forecast for the current day.
- Weekly revenue - Shows aggregated revenue across the current reporting week period clearly.
- Monthly revenue - Shows aggregated revenue across the current reporting month period clearly.
- Average transaction amount - Displays average payment value across recorded parking transactions for administrators.
