- Discount analysis - Summarizes discounts applied across parking payments and eligible customer categories.
- Record parking payment - Saves administrator-entered payment details after verifying amount and customer information.
- Select car or motorcycle - Chooses whether the recorded parking payment belongs to cars motorcycles.
- Select parking duration - Chooses daily weekly or monthly duration for recorded parking payments.
