- Apply PWD discount - Applies configured PWD discount after required eligibility information is provided.
- Apply Senior discount - Applies configured senior discount after required eligibility information is provided.
- Enter discount ID number - Records required identification number supporting PWD or senior discount eligibility.
- Select payment method - Selects cash GCash card or other method for payment records.
