- Transaction logs - Displays detailed recorded payment transactions for administrative review and reconciliation.
- Transaction pagination - Moves between pages when many payment transactions require review efficiently.
- GCash reconciliation warnings - Highlights GCash records requiring administrator reconciliation or further payment review.
