- Motorcycle count - Shows detected motorcycles from selected camera viewpoint currently to operators.
- Camera health status - Summarizes camera online state frames and detection freshness for operators.
- Detection logs - Lists detector updates associated with camera timestamps counts and zones.
- Zone status - Shows each monitored zone's current free or occupied state clearly.
- Free/occupied zone counts - Summarizes free and occupied zones for selected camera view currently.

