Settings
--------

- Gray UI theme toggle - Changes dashboard appearance between dark and gray interface themes manually.
- Manual pricing toggle - Enables administrator controlled pricing instead of automatic occupancy pricing calculations.
- Dynamic pricing mode - Uses occupancy demand to calculate active parking prices automatically today.
