- Motorcycle slot capacity - Configures total parking slots available for motorcycles in operations currently.
- PWD discount toggle - Enables or disables PWD discount eligibility during payment processing workflows.
- Senior discount toggle - Enables or disables senior discount eligibility during payment processing workflows.
- Automatic parking layout - Lets the system choose parking layout from current demand conditions.
- Manual layout override - Lets administrators override automatic layout selection when operational conditions require.
- Normal layout mode - Applies normal parking layout configuration for ordinary demand conditions only.
- Busy layout mode - Applies busy parking layout configuration for elevated demand conditions only.
- High-demand layout mode - Applies high demand layout configuration for heavy demand conditions only.
- Save and refresh settings - Saves changed settings then refreshes displayed values from backend again.


