DRIVER MOBILE APP
=================

Onboarding and authentication
-----------------------------

- Onboarding pages - Explains parking spaces, payments, and smart predictions before account access.
- Skip onboarding - Skips the introduction and goes straight to account access quickly.
- Next onboarding page - Moves the introduction to the next information screen for users.
- Get Started - Finishes introduction and opens the driver login screen for access.
- Login - Checks driver login details with the OccupAI parking system securely.
- Password visibility toggle - Shows or hides the password while the user types it.
- Registration - Makes a new driver account from information provided today securely.
- Confirm password - Checks both passwords match before creating the account successfully today.
- Email validation - Checks email format before allowing a new account to continue.
- Weak-password validation - Rejects passwords missing required length letters or numbers before submission.
- Sign up - Sends entered information to create the driver account successfully online.
- Sign in - Sends login details and opens the driver parking screen successfully.
- Logout - Removes driver login details and returns to the login screen.

Parking
-------

- Live parking availability - Shows current parking spaces using information from the online system.
- Available spaces - Shows free spaces using the latest camera information right now.
- Occupied spaces - Shows occupied spaces using the latest camera information right now.
- Total spaces - Shows all parking spaces so drivers can plan ahead easily.
- Occupancy percentage - Shows how full the parking area is for drivers today.
- Camera data availability - Shows whether camera information is available and updated right now.
- Parking full status - Tells drivers when no parking spaces are left available today.
- Parking location - Shows the parking place address clearly for arriving drivers today.
- Car rate - Shows the current daily price for parking a car today.
- Motorcycle rate - Shows the current daily price for parking a motorcycle today.
- PWD/Senior rate - Shows the lower price after a PWD or senior discount.
- Dynamic pricing information - Explains why the parking price changes when demand changes today.
- Car/motorcycle selection - Lets drivers choose a car or motorcycle before paying online.
- Daily/weekly/monthly duration - Lets drivers choose daily, weekly, or monthly parking time beforehand.
- Regular rate - Uses the normal parking price without a discount for payment.
- PWD discount - Uses the PWD discount after the required identification is entered.
- Senior discount - Uses the senior discount after the required identification is entered.
- Discount ID entry - Collects the identification number needed for the chosen discount today.
- GCash checkout - Starts GCash payment using the driver's selected parking choices securely.
- GCash error/status message - Shows payment progress, errors, or completion messages to drivers clearly.
- Pull-to-refresh - Updates parking information when drivers pull downward on screen manually.
- Offline/loading state - Shows waiting marks or dashes when parking information is unavailable.

History
-------

- All-time history - Shows all parking records available for the driver account today.
- Today's history - Shows parking records made during the current day only here.
- This week's history - Shows parking records made during the current week only here.
- This month's history - Shows parking records made during the current month only here.
- Total sessions - Shows how many parking visits the driver has made overall.
- Total amount spent - Shows how much money the driver has spent overall here.
- Parking payment records - Lists each driver payment with its important details shown clearly.
- Vehicle type display - Shows whether each payment was for a car or motorcycle.
- Duration display - Shows how long each parking visit lasted for drivers clearly.
- Payment method display - Shows whether payment used cash, GCash, card, or something else.
- Discount display - Shows which discount and discount amount each payment received had.
- Date and time display - Shows when each payment happened, including date and time clearly.
- Retry loading history - Tries loading parking history again after a problem occurs online.
- Refresh history - Loads the driver's parking history again from the online system.

Profile
-------

- Profile name - Shows the driver's full name in the profile section clearly.
- Email - Shows the driver's email address in the profile section clearly.
- User role - Shows whether the account belongs to a driver or administrator.
- Account status - Shows whether the driver's account is active and usable today.
- Current free-slot count - Shows free parking spaces beside the driver's profile information clearly.
- Sign out - Ends the driver session and returns to login safely again.


NOTES FOR QA REVIEW
===================

1. Admin Web has PDF and CSV report downloads.
2. Admin App keeps equivalent report data and provides Copy CSV.
3. Driver Web focuses on parking availability, rates, and GCash.
4. Driver App additionally provides History and Profile screens.
5. Both admin platforms support separate car and motorcycle camera POVs.
6. Driver platforms show combined availability and rates, not camera selection.
7. All rates, predictions, capacity, discounts, and statuses come from backend data.
8. The QA teacher can verify each platform using the checklist above.
